Package: smoothclust
Version: 1.9.6
Title: smoothclust
Description: Tools for spatial domain analysis in spatial transcriptomics data.
    Includes spatial smoothing of gene expression profiles for downstream
    clustering and a boundary density (BD) metric for summarizing spatial
    domain organization. The smoothing function returns processed expression
    values for subsequent clustering. BD requires only spatial coordinates
    and categorical labels, and provides local and sample-level summaries
    of label transitions.
